# Class-table features are rules text unless an explicit PCGen numeric grant is present.
Sentinel Reserve Points (Reference)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresClassFeature	DEFINE:SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_POINTS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_POINTS|max(1,floor(SPHERES_SENTINEL_LEVEL/2)+WIS)	DESC:%SPHERES_SENTINEL_RESERVE_POINTS daily reserve points; temporary HP from a spent point is 2 x BAB + WIS; apply to qualifying rolls or uses only.
